  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">11th EDF Support to Wider Caribbean Cooperation: Regional Technical Cooperation Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the 11th EDF Support to Advance Wider Caribbean Cooperation is the sustainable social and economic development of the CARIFORUM States, FCORs, and OCT&#xbf;s in the Wider Caribbean Region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Specific Objective of the 11th EDF Support to Advance Wider Caribbean Cooperation:&amp;nbsp;Regional Technical Cooperation Facility is to swiftly:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(i)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;address issues hampering the successful implementation of the Caribbean Regional Indicative Programme (CRIP) as it relates to Wider Caribbean Cooperation and Integration and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(ii) facilitate planning for post Cotonou development programmes for the Caribbean region&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
